Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.90,0:23:40.94,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}生きてかなくちゃ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.94,0:23:45.61,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}明日が待ち迎えてる
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.61,0:23:51.20,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果てしなくて　儚いね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.20,0:23:57.38,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心なんて　どこにも　ないと思えばいい
Dialogue: 1,0:23:57.63,0:24:00.63,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}まぶしくて
